From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:55:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] HID: add spi-hid-duo, the Surface Duo digitizer transport

Microsoft's v0.9 HID-over-SPI driver from their Surface Duo kernel, ported to v6.19: one HID device per screen,
the digitizer's heatmap reports for iptsd. (To be replaced by the upstream spi-hid series plus Duo quirks.)

This patch was written by Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant) under the direction of Bryson, who reviewed and
tested it on a Surface Duo.

Signed-off-by: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
---
